  "notes": [
    "The A division was split into two parallel round robins, 'A (Alicia)' and 'A (Bogdan)', each of 11 players. Top 7 of each made the second stage, top 2 getting a first-round bye.",
    "The championship bracket then COMBINES qualifiers from both A groups and re-seeds them 1-8, so the bracket seeds are not the group ranks.",
    "There is also a 4-player consolation bracket, whose entrants are drawn from across both A groups and Division B.",
    "Division B has standings but NO bracket in the source files, so no B playoff is recorded.",
    "Standings are a PNG screenshot with no text layer and were read visually.",
    "The bronze medal game (Shawn B vs Luis) is printed on the championship bracket but no winner is marked, so no third placement is recorded.",
    "The consolation final is annotated 'wins in 4 games', so the consolation was a race to 4; only the winner's score is known.",
    "Division B row 11 is 'Free win', a placeholder rather than a person, and is dropped.",
    "Michael appears here as 'GeorgeDubyuh'; in tournaments 12 and 14 the same display name is 'KnotYourCapitan'. Treated as one person who changed username \u2014 see data/players.json.",
    "B division playoff placings recovered from TournamentResults.pdf (1 Paul, 2 Dan, ... 10 Gustavo). No B bracket exists in the source files, so no matches are recorded.",
    "TournamentResults.pdf gives BOTH Shawn B and Luis fourth place in the A division, confirming the bronze medal game printed on the bracket was never decided."
  ],
